                                                "sense_id": "a6b33a1b-2489-31cb-987f-289026a3c2d6",
                                                "text": "Some of these file binders can produce files that can't be detected by some anti-viruses, and if downloaded and run by an unsuspecting user, it can result in a system compromise."
